1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,699
BRAMBLE: Case open!

2
00:00:01,699 --> 00:00:04,413
OTTO: Oh no! Which bucket is mine?

3
00:00:04,613 --> 00:00:07,474
IVY: The tags have dots, not names.

4
00:00:07,874 --> 00:00:12,103
Today's case: clapping the syllables in our names.

5
00:00:12,403 --> 00:00:16,348
A syllable is a beat in a word.

6
00:00:16,748 --> 00:00:18,460
It's like lamington.

7
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:21,831
Lam-ing-ton.

8
00:00:23,331 --> 00:00:24,919
Three claps.

9
00:00:25,519 --> 00:00:28,505
OTTO: One dot! O for Otto! Mine!

10
00:00:28,905 --> 00:00:31,767
IVY: Hmm. Pip has a bucket too.

11
00:00:32,167 --> 00:00:34,761
BRAMBLE: Let's not guess. Let's test.

12
00:00:35,161 --> 00:00:38,148
BRAMBLE: Can you show me two claps?

13
00:00:41,748 --> 00:00:44,411
BRAMBLE: Which tag has Otto's claps?

14
00:00:44,811 --> 00:00:47,236
A. One dot.

15
00:00:47,436 --> 00:00:50,358
B. Two dots.

16
00:00:50,558 --> 00:00:52,471
Pause and think.

17
00:00:57,071 --> 00:00:59,791
Clap once for each syllable.

18
00:01:00,191 --> 00:01:01,478
Ot-to.

19
00:01:02,778 --> 00:01:05,306
Two claps for Otto.

20
00:01:05,706 --> 00:01:06,592
Pip.

21
00:01:07,392 --> 00:01:09,615
One clap for Pip.

22
00:01:10,015 --> 00:01:12,155
It's B! Two dots.

23
00:01:12,355 --> 00:01:14,766
OTTO: Oh! The dots are claps!

24
00:01:15,166 --> 00:01:19,261
BRAMBLE: Let's check another way. Flip the tag.

25
00:01:19,661 --> 00:01:22,252
The back says Otto!

26
00:01:22,652 --> 00:01:24,457
IVY: Both clues match!

27
00:01:24,857 --> 00:01:26,129
BRAMBLE: Case solved!

28
00:01:27,629 --> 00:01:29,817
IVY: Now clap Detective Bramble.

29
00:01:31,317 --> 00:01:34,283
OTTO: Five claps! My paws are tired!

30
00:01:34,883 --> 00:01:38,633
Remember. Clap once for each syllable.

31
00:01:39,133 --> 00:01:43,500
Say it with me. Clap once for each syllable.

32
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:49,579
Try it at home. Clap your own name.

33
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:54,103
Next case: the name on a muddy sign.

